# People the maintainer trusts to contribute to Mado, and people blocked from
# it. Collaborators and bots are trusted without an entry. Someone is vouched
# after a merged pull request, or after taking a roadmap task with the
# maintainer's agreement on its issue.
#
# Syntax (github.com/mitchellh/vouch):
#   github:username
#   -github:username reason for the denouncement
#
# Keep entries sorted. Only the maintainer changes this file.
